# Waveform interaction invariants (WAVEFORM_INTERACTION_CLOSURE_V1)

## Before marking done

1. Run `bash Production/scripts/verify_waveform_interaction_closure.sh`
2. If UI ships: deploy + fleet build-sha parity + live Event_3 `:5113` proof (not fixture-only)

## Never

- Silent `return` on drop when `!isReady` or `durationMs <= 0` — use `waveformInteractionPolicy` + toast (WTA-5)
- Zero `timeAuthority.setDurationMs(0)` on audioSrc remount (WTA-13)
- Drag-seek handlers inside WaveSurfer mount `useEffect`
- `pointer-events: auto` on full `.mn-waveform-cue-block` without handles auto
- Mark WTA rows "shipped" with grep-only proof — require behavioral e2e or live Event_3

